      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[5]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 134,
      "endIndex": 155,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "1. Problem Statement",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00006",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[6]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 155,
      "endIndex": 452,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "When a clinician reviews the Interactions accordion in a drug monograph, they can see interaction information but do not have a direct way to open the Medscape Interaction Checker from that context. This creates an unnecessary break between reviewing a drug and checking a medication combination.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00007",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[7]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 452,
      "endIndex": 453,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00008",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[8]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 453,
      "endIndex": 730,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Phase 1 adds one clear access point: selecting Check interactions in the Interactions accordion opens the existing Medscape Interaction Checker in a sidebar, with the current monograph drug already added to the checker, while keeping the monograph available in the background.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00009",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[9]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 730,
      "endIndex": 731,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00010",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[10]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 731,
      "endIndex": 740,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "2. Goals",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00011",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[11]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 740,
      "endIndex": 841,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.6q9yyr9v1kw7",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Give clinicians a clear, in-context path from the Interactions accordion to the Interaction Checker.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00012",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[12]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 841,
      "endIndex": 909,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.6q9yyr9v1kw7",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Start the checker with the current monograph drug already included.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00013",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[13]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 909,
      "endIndex": 985,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.6q9yyr9v1kw7",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Preserve the established V2 Interaction Checker experience once it is open.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00014",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[14]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 985,
      "endIndex": 987,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "[INLINE_OBJECT kix.9fy1kt4xfl2m]",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00015",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[15]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 987,
      "endIndex": 989,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "[INLINE_OBJECT kix.o92lrlctsbrv]",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00016",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[16]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 989,
      "endIndex": 990,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
