      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5073,
      "endIndex": 5095,
      "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "8. Definition of Done",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00065",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[65]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5095,
      "endIndex": 5151,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Phase 1 is complete when all of the following are true:",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00066",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[66]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5151,
      "endIndex": 5272,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.4r1uax3m0web",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Check interactions is available from the Interactions accordion and opens the existing Interaction Checker in a sidebar.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00067",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[67]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5272,
      "endIndex": 5367,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.4r1uax3m0web",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The current monograph drug is already added to the Interaction Checker when the sidebar opens.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00068",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[68]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5367,
      "endIndex": 5502,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.4r1uax3m0web",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The open and close path preserves the clinician's monograph context, including the Interactions accordion context and scroll position.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00069",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[69]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5502,
      "endIndex": 5600,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.4r1uax3m0web",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The action and sidebar are operable with a keyboard and understandable with assistive technology.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00070",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[70]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5600,
      "endIndex": 5707,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.4r1uax3m0web",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The established checker experience is available without changing its medication-entry or results behavior.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00071",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[71]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5707,
      "endIndex": 5823,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.4r1uax3m0web",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "Loading and unavailable states allow the sidebar to be dismissed so the clinician can continue using the monograph.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00072",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[72]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5823,
      "endIndex": 5959,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": true,
      "listId": "kix.4r1uax3m0web",
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "The approved narrow-viewport presentation is validated, and the release-quality and user-outcome measurements are ready to be assessed.",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
    {
      "paragraphId": "P00073",
      "path": "tabs.t.0.body.content[73]",
      "tabId": "t.0",
      "tabTitle": "Tab 1",
      "segmentId": null,
      "startIndex": 5959,
      "endIndex": 5960,
      "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
      "isListItem": false,
      "listId": null,
      "nestingLevel": null,
      "table": null,
      "text": "",
      "protectedControls": []
    },
